      "content": "counselors aren't gonna fix this. it's too much. it's not just the money, it's the way everyone looks at me now. my family, my neighbors... it's like i've failed at the one thing i was supposed to do, just keep things together. i feel so much shame i can't even look in the mirror. it feels like the more i fight, the more i'm just making a fool of myself. there's no dignified way to handle this. it's just a constant, humiliating spiral.",
